<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span> Privacy Policy</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
<p style="color:var(--gray-500);margin-bottom:32px">Last updated: January 2025</p>
<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:12px">Information We Collect</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">We collect information you provide when submitting admission enquiries, contact forms, or subscribing to our newsletter. This includes your name, phone number, email address, and any message you send us.</p>
<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">We use the information to respond to your enquiries, process admission applications, send school updates (newsletter), and improve our services. We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties.</p>
<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Cookies</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">We use session cookies necessary for the website to function. You may disable cookies in your browser settings, though this may affect some site features.</p>
<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Data Security</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information against unauthorised access. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>
<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Contact</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9">For privacy-related queries, contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= school.email %>" style="color:var(--green)"><%= school.email %></a>.</p>
</div></section>
